sequenceDiagram
    title Invariant — SessionState is REPL-thread-exclusive — workers reach in only via handoffs

    participant User as User
    participant REPL as REPL Thread
    participant Session as SessionState
    participant Sched as Compilation Scheduler
    participant PW as Priority Worker
    participant ResultCh as Result Channel

    Note over Session: invariant: only the REPL thread mutates SessionState<br/>(current_module, history, prompt context, repl_check_state)

    User ->> REPL: input
    REPL ->> Session: read current_module
    REPL ->> Session: write history.append(input)
    REPL ->> Session: snapshot repl_check_state (for rollback)

    REPL ->> Sched: EvalSubmission(handoff value)
    Note over Sched,PW: handoff value carries everything needed.<br/>worker does NOT read SessionState

    Sched ->> PW: enqueue
    PW ->> PW: typecheck + JIT-compile
    PW ->> ResultCh: EvalResult (handoff value)

    REPL ->> ResultCh: blocking recv
    ResultCh -->> REPL: EvalResult

    REPL ->> Session: write last_result
    REPL ->> Session: commit / rollback repl_check_state
    REPL ->> User: display

    Note over Session: workers never touched Session.<br/>access containment IS concurrency containment
